<title>GERMANY: Air mail at Frankfurt airport down 17.5pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Air mail at Frankfurt airport down 17.5pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air mail handled at Frankfurt airport in February declined 17.5 percent, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>Imported mail declined substantially while the overnight domestic postal service has now stabilised at about 15 percent down on last year, the monthly Flughafen Frankfurt Main AG (FAG) traffic report said.</p>
<p>The following tables show mail handled at Frankfurt airport in February and for the year to date in tonnes and with year-on-year percentage changes.</p>
<p>    Feb 1997			Monthly total	Pct change</p>
<p>    Total mail			11,632		Down 17.5</p>
<p>    Foreign			    4,288		Down 12.0</p>
<p>    Domestic			   7,080		Down 21.5</p>
<p>    Transit				264		Up   34.0</p>
<p>    Jan-Feb 1997		 Cumulative total    Pct change</p>
<p>    Total mail			24,171		Down 14.0</p>
<p>    Foreign			    8,911		Down  7.3</p>
<p>    Domestic			  14,752		Down 18.5</p>
<p>    Transit				507		Up   32.4</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
